    <p style='padding-top: 7pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
    <h1 style='padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>PAYMENT OF LOAN TO CREDITOR</h1>
    <p style='padding-top: 10pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 114%;text-align: justify;'>The parties
        agree that the loan amount will be paid to the Creditor after the expiry of five business days after the
        conclusion of this contract. During this period the Creditor may terminate the contract at will.</p>
    <p style='padding-top: 11pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
    <h1 style='padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><a name='bookmark6'>&zwnj;</a>REPAYMENT OF LOAN
    </h1>
    <p style='padding-top: 10pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 114%;text-align: justify;'>The Debtor
        will pay the loan amount to the Creditor in weekly/monthly/quarterly instalments of Rs<u>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
        </u>(in words),commencing as from <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
            (year)</u> until all amounts owing in terms hereof have been paid in full which would be <u><b>x
            </b></u>instalments.</p>
    <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
    <h1 style='padding-left: 8pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: justify;'><a name='bookmark7'>&zwnj;</a>PLACE OF PAYMENT
    </h1>
    <h1 style='padding-top: 9pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: justify;'><a
            name='bookmark8'>&zwnj;</a>All payments in respect of the loan amount, interest and other monies due in
        terms of this acknowledgement shall be made into the Creditor's banking account, the Creditor's banking details are as follows:<u>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</u>
	</h1>

    <p style='padding-top: 9pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 114%;text-align: justify;'>All monthly
        payments by the Debtor must be made by the Debtor on or before the 28th day of every month.</p>
    <p style='padding-top: 9pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 114%;text-align: justify;'>Should the
        Debtor not be able to afford a payment, then it will be the responsibility of the Debtor to inform the Creditor
        and to bring proof of income and expenditure to the Creditor indicating that the Debtor is not able to afford
        payment.</p>
    <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
    <h1 style='padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: justify;'><a name='bookmark9'>&zwnj;</a>RENUNCIATION OF
        BENEFITS</h1>
    <p style='padding-top: 10pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 112%;text-align: justify;'>The Debtor
        hereby expressly renounces the benefits of the <i>non causa debiti, </i>the <i>errore calculi, </i>the revision
        of accounts; no value received and, if there is more than one debtor, the I or the <i>ordinis</i></p>
    <p class='s3' style='padding-top: 3pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 114%;text-align: justify;'>seu
