            and the effect of its renunciation.</span></p>
    <h1 style='padding-top: 9pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><a
            name='bookmark10'>&zwnj;</a>ACCELERATION CLAUSE</h1>
    <p style='padding-top: 10pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 114%;text-align: justify;'>Should the
        Debtor fail to pay any amount due and payable under this acknowledgement on the respective due dates, the
        principal debit, interest, and all other amounts due under this acknowledgement will immediately be due and
        payable on 7 (seven) days’ notice (not- withstanding any condition contained herein to the contrary), which
        notice shall be given in writing to me by the Creditor.</p>
    <p style='padding-top: 8pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 112%;text-align: justify;'>The Debtor
        agrees that, in the event of my failure to effect payments as set out above, that he / she shall be liable for
        payment of legal costs on an attorney and client scale.</p>
    <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
    <h1 style='padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><a name='bookmark11'>&zwnj;</a>JURISDICTION</h1>
    <p style='padding-top: 10pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 112%;text-align: justify;'>I agree to
        the jurisdiction of the Magistrates Court for any dispute that may arise under this Acknowledgement of Debt.</p>
    <h1 style='padding-top: 9pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><a
            name='bookmark12'>&zwnj;</a>WAIVER</h1>
    <p style='padding-top: 10pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 114%;text-align: justify;'>No
        indulgence, latitude or extension of time which may be allowed to me in respect of any payment or any matter
        provided for herein shall under any circumstances be deemed to be a waiver of the Creditor’s rights at any time
        and the Creditor shall without notice be entitled to require strict and punctual compliance with each and every
        provision or term hereof.</p>
    <h1 style='padding-top: 9pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><a
            name='bookmark13'>&zwnj;</a>PREPAYMENT BY DEBTOR</h1>
    <p style='padding-top: 10pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 114%;text-align: justify;'>The Debtor
        shall be entitled to pay larger instalments than prescribed or the full balance of capital and interest at any
        time prior to the due dates for. In that event interest shall be calculated up to the date of payment.</p>
    <h1 style='padding-top: 9pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><a name='bookmark14'>&zwnj;</a>THE
        WHOLE CONTRACT</h1>
    <p style='padding-top: 10pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 114%;text-align: justify;'>No variation,
        alteration, amendment, modification or cancellation of this acknowledgement of debt or of the terms hereof shall
        be of any force or effect unless reduced to writing and signed by both parties.</p>
    <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
    <h1 style='padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><a name='bookmark15'>&zwnj;</a>DEBT REPAYMENT</h1>
    <p style='padding-top: 10pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 114%;text-align: justify;'>Repayment
