        <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </u>)only and assets and
        properties mentioned in the Schedule hereunder as his absolute property and he is desirous of creating a
        Religious/ Charitable/Educational Trust for the benefit of the humanity at large/ beneficiary…………...
    </p>
    <h2 style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>AND WHEREAS <span class='p'>each
            of the parties hereto of the &quot;Other Part&quot; has individually and jointly has agreed to act as
            Trustees of the Trust, proposed by the party of the first part.</span></h2>
    <h2 style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>AND WHEREAS <span
            class='p'>nothing contained in this deed shall be deemed to authorize the trustees to do any act which may
            in any way be construed statutory modifications thereof and all activities of the trust shall be carried out
            with a view to benefit the public at large, without any profit motive and in accordance with the provisions
            of the Income Tax Act, 1961.</span></h2>
    <p style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>AND WHEREAS the trust is hereby
        expressly declared to be a public charitable trust and all the provisions of this deed are to be constituted
        accordingly.</p>
    <h2 style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>NOW THIS DEED OF TRUST WITNESSETH
        AS FOLLOWS:</h2>
    <ol id='l1'>
        <li data-list-text='1.'>
            <h2 style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 15pt;text-indent: -10pt;text-align: left;'>NAME:</h2>
            <p style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>The name of the Trust shall
                be &quot;<u>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                </u>&quot;.</p>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='2.'>
            <h2 style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 15pt;text-indent: -10pt;text-align: left;'>PLACE:</h2>
            <p style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>The principal office of the
                Trust shall be situated at
                <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                </u>.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='3.'>
            <h2 style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 15pt;text-indent: -10pt;text-align: left;'>OBJECTIVES<span
                    class='p'>:</span></h2>
            <p style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>The objects for which the
                Trust is Established are – 1,2,3………..</p>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='4.'>
            <h2 style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 15pt;text-indent: -10pt;text-align: left;'>BENEFICIARIES:</h2>
            <p style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>The Trust is established
                for the benefit of (List</p>
            <p style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>of beneficiaries and their
                respective rights)</p>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='5.'>
            <h2 style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 15pt;text-indent: -10pt;text-align: left;'>DURATION OF THE TRUST
            </h2>
            <p style='padding-top: 12pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 115%;text-align: left;'>The
                Trust shall commence on the date of execution of this Deed and shall continue until [Specify duration or
                conditions for termination].</p>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='6.'>
            <h2 style='padding-top: 2pt;padding-left: 15pt;text-indent: -10pt;text-align: left;'>PROPERTIES:</h2>
            <h2 style='padding-top: 7pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>TRUST WITHOUT PROPERTY
            </h2>
            <p style='padding-left: 7pt;text-indent: -2pt;line-height: 21pt;text-align: left;'>The Trust has no property
                or assets, either movable or immovable, other than the Trust Fund The party of the first part, the
                SETTLOR, does hereby settle the sum of Rs.<u>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </u>/- (Rs.</p>
            <p style='padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><u>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </u>only) in
                Trust, with the name and for the objects hereinafter stated, by delivering the said amount which the
