<body>
    <h2 style='padding-top: 3pt;padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 113%;text-align: center;'>ARTICLES OF
        ASSOCIATION OF [COMPANY NAME]</h2><br>
    <h2 style='padding-left: 5pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 120%;text-align: center;'>[Company Registration Number]
        Incorporated under the Companies Act, 2013</h2>
    <ol id='l1'>
        <li data-list-text='1.'>
            <h1 style='padding-top: 12pt;padding-left: 19pt;text-indent: -14pt;text-align: left;'><a
                    name='bookmark0'>&zwnj;</a>PRELIMINARY</h1>
            <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
            <ol id='l2'>
                <li data-list-text='1.1.'>
                    <p style=' padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 115%;text-align: left;'>The regulations
                        contained in Table F of Schedule I of the Companies Act, 2013, shall apply to the Company except
                        as modified by these Articles.</p>
                </li>
                <li data-list-text='1.2.'>
                    <p style='padding-top: 5pt;padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 115%;text-align: left;'>
                        These Articles
                        are the Articles of Association of <span class='h2'>[Company Name]</span>.</p>
                    <p style='padding-top: 2pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='2.'>
            <h1 style='padding-left: 19pt;text-indent: -14pt;text-align: left;'><a
                    name='bookmark1'>&zwnj;</a>INTERPRETATION</h1>
            <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
            <ol id='l3'>
                <li data-list-text='2.1.'>
                    <p style='padding-left: 26pt;text-align: left;'>In these Articles, unless the
                        context otherwise requires:</p>
                    <p style='padding-top: 1pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                    <ul id='l4'>
                        <li data-list-text='●'>
                            <p style='padding-left: 41pt;text-align: left;'>&quot;Act&quot; means the
                                Companies Act, 2013, or any statutory modification thereof.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li data-list-text='●'>
                            <p style='padding-top: 2pt;padding-left: 41pt;text-align: left;'>
                                &quot;Company&quot; refers to <span class='h2'>[Company Name]</span>.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li data-list-text='●'>
                            <p style='padding-top: 2pt;padding-left: 41pt;text-align: left;'>
                                &quot;Board&quot; means the board of directors of the Company.</p>
                            <p style='padding-top: 1pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li data-list-text='2.2.'>
                    <p style='padding-left: 25pt;text-align: left;'>Words denoting the singular
                        number shall include the plural and vice versa.</p>
                    <p style='padding-top: 2pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='3.'>
            <h1 style='padding-left: 19pt;text-indent: -14pt;text-align: left;'><a name='bookmark2'>&zwnj;</a>COMPANY
                NAME</h1>
            <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
            <p style='padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'>The name of the Company shall be <span
                    class='h2'>[Company Name]</span>.</p>
            <p style='padding-top: 3pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='4.'>
            <h1 style='padding-left: 19pt;text-indent: -14pt;text-align: left;'><a name='bookmark3'>&zwnj;</a>REGISTERED
                OFFICE</h1>
            <p style='padding-top: 14pt;padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 119%;text-align: left;'>The
                registered office of the Company shall be located at <span class='h2'>[Address]</span>, or as decided by
                the Board of Directors.</p>
            <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='5.'>
            <h1 style='padding-left: 19pt;text-indent: -14pt;text-align: left;'><a name='bookmark4'>&zwnj;</a>OBJECTS OF
                THE COMPANY</h1>
            <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
            <ol id='l5'>
                <li data-list-text='5.1.'>
                    <p style='padding-left: 26pt;text-align: left;'>The primary objects of the
                        Company are:</p>
                    <p style='padding-top: 1pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                    <ul id='l6'>
                        <li data-list-text='●'>
                            <p style='padding-left: 41pt;text-align: left;'>To engage in <span class='h2'>[describe
                                    primary business activities]</span>.</p>
                            <p style='padding-top: 1pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li data-list-text='5.2.'>
                    <p style='padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 118%;text-align: left;'>The Company may
                        engage in any other lawful activities as permitted under the Companies Act, 2013.</p>
                    <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='6.'>
            <h1 style='padding-left: 19pt;text-indent: -14pt;text-align: left;'><a name='bookmark5'>&zwnj;</a>CAPITAL
                STRUCTURE</h1>
            <ol id='l7'>
                <li data-list-text='6.1.'>
                    <p style='padding-top: 14pt;padding-left: 26pt;text-align: left;'>The authorized
                        share capital of the Company shall be <span class='h2'>[Amount in INR]</span>, divided into
                        <span class='h2'> [Number and Class
                            of Shares].</span></p>
                </li>
                <li data-list-text='6.2.'>
                    <p style='padding-top: 3pt;padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 120%;text-align: left;'>
                        The share capital may be increased, reduced, or otherwise altered as permitted by the Companies
                        Act, 2013.</p>
                    <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='7.'>
            <h1 style='padding-left: 19pt;text-indent: -14pt;text-align: left;'><a name='bookmark6'>&zwnj;</a>SHARES
            </h1>
            <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
            <ol id='l8'>
                <li data-list-text='7.1.'>
                    <p style='padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 115%;text-align: left;'>The shares of the
                        Company shall be under the control of the Board of Directors, who may allot, issue, or dispose
                        of shares as deemed appropriate.</p>
                </li>
                <li data-list-text='7.2.'>
                    <p style='padding-top: 11pt;padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 120%;text-align: left;'>
                        Every shareholder whose name appears in the Register of Members shall receive a certificate for
                        the shares held.</p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='8.'>
            <h1 style='padding-top: 12pt;padding-left: 19pt;text-indent: -14pt;text-align: left;'><a
                    name='bookmark7'>&zwnj;</a>TRANSFER OF SHARES</h1>
            <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
            <ol id='l9'>
                <li data-list-text='8.1.'>
                    <p style='padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 115%;text-align: left;'>Shares of the
                        Company are transferable in the manner prescribed under the Act and as specified in these
                        Articles.</p>
                </li>
                <li data-list-text='8.2.'>
                    <p style='padding-top: 11pt;padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 120%;text-align: left;'>
                        A transfer shall be effective upon registration of the transfer with the Company and approval by
                        the Board of Directors.</p>
                    <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='9.'>
            <h1 style='padding-left: 19pt;text-indent: -14pt;text-align: left;'><a name='bookmark8'>&zwnj;</a>GENERAL
                MEETINGS</h1>
            <p style='text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
            <ol id='l10'>
                <li data-list-text='9.1.'>
                    <p style='padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: 0pt;line-height: 120%;text-align: left;'>The Company shall
                        conduct an annual general meeting within six months from the end of each financial year.</p>
                </li>
                <li data-list-text='9.2.'>
                    <p style='padding-top: 11pt;padding-left: 26pt;text-align: left;'>The Board may
                        convene an extraordinary general meeting as needed.</p>
                    <p style='padding-top: 2pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </li>
        <li data-list-text='10.'>
            <h1 style='padding-left: 26pt;text-indent: -21pt;text-align: left;'><a name='bookmark9'>&zwnj;</a>BOARD OF
                DIRECTORS</h1>
            <ol id='l11'>
                <li data-list-text='10.1.'>
                    <p style='padding-top: 26pt;padding-left: 26pt;text-align: left;'>The Board shall
                        consist of a minimum of <span class='h2'>[Minimum Number] </span>and a maximum of <span class='h2'>[Maximum Number] </span> <span class='p'>directors, as prescribed by the Act.</span></p>
                    
                    <p style='padding-top: 1pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                </li>
                <li data-list-text='10.2.'>
                    <p style='padding-left: 26pt;text-align: left;'>The initial directors of the
                        Company are:</p>
                    <p style='padding-top: 1pt;text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;'><br /></p>
                    <ul id='l12'>
                        <li data-list-text='●'>
