  ii.	Sublessee's responsibility: the sub lessee shall be responsible for keeping the subleased premises in good condition and shall cover any damages caused by their own actions<br>
  iii.	Sublessor's responsibilities: the sublessor shall remain responsible for any major repairs required under the terms of the original lease, provided such repairs are not caused by the sublessee's actions.<br>
  j.	The sub lessee shall not make any structural alterations to the subleased premises without the written consent of the sublessor and the lessor.<br>
  k.	The sublessor may terminate this underlease if the sublessee violates any of the terms of this deed or the original lease. The underlease shall also terminate automatically if the original lease is terminated<br>
  3.	The lessor's written consent is required for this underlease to be effective, and any such actions taken without such consent shall render the underlease void<br>
  4.	The underlease deed shall be governed by the laws of the state of Assam, and any such disputes arising from this underlease shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the courts of Assam<br>
  </span>
</p>";
